<%# ==========================================================================
    DYNAMIC MARK — the Cognitrixx logo, lit one part at a time.

    Three copies of the same artwork, stacked: a dim base that keeps the whole
    form readable, and two lit copies, each masked by a conic sweep that
    travels round the logo's centre. Only the arm under a sweep glows, so the
    light runs round the triangle face by face instead of the mark sitting
    uniformly lit. The second sweep trails the first at half strength.
    Pure CSS (registered --dm-a angle); reduced motion shows the mark lit.
    ========================================================================== %>
<div class="dynmark<%= typeof extra !== 'undefined' ? ' ' + extra : '' %>" aria-hidden="true">
  <img class="dynmark__base" src="/images/cognitrixx-mark-1024.webp" alt="" width="1009" height="987" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
  <img class="dynmark__lit" src="/images/cognitrixx-mark-1024.webp" alt="" width="1009" height="987" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
  <img class="dynmark__lit dynmark__lit--trail" src="/images/cognitrixx-mark-1024.webp" alt="" width="1009" height="987" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
</div>
